From 81053995563a2e8eeeb2a4f4ea179456b0f5cb9f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Floyd <git@notmy.space>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 20:09:11 +0000
Subject: ipa: soft: Add lens shading correction

The lens passes less light to the image corners than to its centre, and
not equally per colour. Add an Lsc algorithm taking per-channel gain
grids measured under several illuminants, interpolating them by the AWB
colour temperature, and a lens shading stage in the GPU debayer that
samples the grid as a linearly filtered texture after black level
subtraction.

The grid is fixed at 17x13 points, the layout of Qualcomm Chromatix
lens shading tables. Gains are encoded in DebayerParams as fractions of
the range [1, kLscGainMax] in the width of LscValue.

Signed-off-by: William Floyd <git@notmy.space>
